{"seq":3,"slug":"quantitative-management","title":"定量管理方法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"定量管理方法-简介\">定量管理方法 简介</h1><p>定量管理方法运用数学模型、统计分析和计算模拟为管理决策提供精确的定量支持。在大数据和人工智能快速发展的背景下，量化分析能力已成为管理学研究和实践不可缺少的核心技能。</p>\n<p>本课程沿着&quot;决策建模—运营优化—仿真模拟—数据驱动&quot;的技术链路展开，帮助学习者构建从经典运筹学到现代数据分析的方法体系。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>管理决策模型</strong>介绍支撑管理决策的经典数学模型，包括线性规划在资源最优配置中的建模方法、决策树与效用理论在不确定性决策中的分析框架，以及博弈论在竞争互动和合作策略中的应用逻辑。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>运营管理方法</strong>聚焦运营系统中的核心优化问题，涵盖排队论对服务系统等待与容量的分析、库存优化中经济订货量和安全库存的计算策略，以及供应链网络的建模方法和多目标优化技术。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>仿真与模拟</strong>讲解当解析模型难以求解时通过计算机模拟探索系统行为的方法，包括蒙特卡洛模拟在风险分析中的应用、系统动力学在管理反馈回路中的建模方式，以及离散事件仿真在流程优化和产能规划中的实践。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>数据驱动管理</strong>关注机器学习和文本分析在管理研究中的新兴应用，介绍商业分析的主要方法与工具、监督学习和无监督学习在管理问题中的适用场景，以及文本分析技术在舆情监测、客户反馈挖掘等管理场景中的实践。</p>\n<p>建议学习者具备线性代数、概率统计和基础编程的知识后进入本课程，四个章节既可按顺序系统学习，也可根据研究需要选择性深入。建模能力的提升需要大量的练习和实际问题的反复训练。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"decision-models","title":"管理决策模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/decision-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-programming","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 线性规划","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/decision-models/linear-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"decision-trees-utility","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 决策树与效用理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/decision-models/decision-trees-utility"},{"seq":3,"slug":"game-theory-management","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 博弈论在管理中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/decision-models/game-theory-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"operations","title":"运营管理方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"queuing-theory","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 排队论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/operations/queuing-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inventory-optimization","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 库存优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/operations/inventory-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-chain-modeling","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 供应链建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/operations/supply-chain-modeling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"simulation","title":"仿真与模拟","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/simulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monte-carlo-simulation","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 蒙特卡洛模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/simulation/monte-carlo-simulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"system-dynamics-management","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 管理中的系统动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/simulation/system-dynamics-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"discrete-event-sim-mgmt","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 离散事件仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/simulation/discrete-event-sim-mgmt"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-driven","title":"数据驱动管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/data-driven","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"business-analytics-methods","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 商业分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/data-driven/business-analytics-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"machine-learning-management","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 管理中的机器学习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/data-driven/machine-learning-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"text-analytics-management","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 管理中的文本分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/data-driven/text-analytics-management"}]}]}